@page "/privacy"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - BowlNEBA</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description"
          content="How the New England Bowling Association collects, uses, and protects your information." />
</HeadContent>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900" style="font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated July 31, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
            <p>
                The New England Bowling Association ("NEBA," "we," "us," or "our") operates bowlneba.com. This
                policy explains what information we collect through the site, how we use it, and who to contact
                with questions.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li>
                    <strong>Account information.</strong> If you create an account, we store your name, email
                    address, and login credentials.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Tournament and membership records.</strong> Bowler names, scores, standings, awards, and
                    related tournament history are maintained as part of NEBA's public competitive records.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Correspondence.</strong> If you email us or use the contact page, we keep the content of
                    that message and your email address to respond to you.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Usage data.</strong> We collect standard technical data about site visits (such as pages
                    viewed and error diagnostics) to keep the site running and to fix problems.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">How we use information</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li>To operate tournaments, membership, and the competitive records published on this site.</li>
                <li>To respond to questions sent through the contact page or by email.</li>
                <li>To maintain, secure, and improve the website.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your information, and we do not use it for advertising.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Sharing</h2>
            <p>
                We do not share your personal information with third parties except: service providers who help us
                run the site (such as hosting and email delivery), or when required by law.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                We use cookies only as needed to keep you signed in and to remember basic site preferences. We do
                not use cookies for advertising or third-party tracking.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Data retention</h2>
            <p>
                Tournament and competitive records are kept indefinitely as part of NEBA's historical record.
                Account information is kept for as long as your account is active, or as needed to comply with our
                legal obligations.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Your choices</h2>
            <p>
                You can ask us to review, correct, or delete your account information at any time by emailing
                <a href="mailto:website@bowlneba.com" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline">website@bowlneba.com</a>.
                Because tournament results are part of NEBA's public competitive record, we generally do not remove
                them, but we will correct factual errors.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top of this page
                reflects the most recent change.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Contact us</h2>
            <p>
                Questions about this policy can be sent to
                <a href="mailto:website@bowlneba.com" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline">website@bowlneba.com</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
